ity loans and home equity lines of credit; and credit cards for consumers and businesses. In addition, the company provides investment products; brokerage and investment advisory programs; and fiduciary and investment services, including personal trust, investment management, estate administration, endowments, foundations, individual retirement accounts, escrow services, and custody. Further, it offers insurance agency services in the property and casualty area; investment, merger and acquisition advisory services, private debt, equity and mezzanine placement services, and other middle-market advisory services; and other banking services, including telephone and online banking, mobile banking, debit cards, direct deposit and remote deposit capture, mobile deposit option, automated teller machine, and cash management services. Pinnacle Financial Partners, Inc. was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Atlanta, Georgia.","employees":8649,"website":"https://www.pnfp.com","country":"United States","city":"Atlanta","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Michael Terry Turner","title":"Founder & Chairman"},{"name":"Mr. Robert A. McCabe Jr.","title":"Founder, Executive VP, Chief Banking Officer & Vice Chair"},{"name":"Mr. Richard D. Callicutt II","title":"Chairman of Carolinas, Virginia & National Capital Regions"}]},"sector_medians":{"fpe":10.51,"tpe":12.61,"ps":3.433,"pfcf":11.7,"peg":1.31,"pb":1.596,"ev_ebitda":10.74,"rev_growth":0.106,"eps_growth":0.16,"eps_growth_fwd":0.1329,"eps_growth_next":0.1099,"div_yield":0.02175,"roe":0.1268,"roa":0.01564,"de":54.45,"gross_margin":0.2391,"op_margin":0.3554,"profit_margin":0.2541,"current_ratio":1.509},"valuation":[{"k":"fpe","label":"Forward P/E","v":8.53,"sector":10.51,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"tpe","label":"TTM P/E","v":13.28,"sector":12.61,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"ps","label":"Price / Sales","v":3.737,"sector":3.433,"verdict":"Fairly valued"},{"k":"pfcf","label":"Price / FCF","v":null,"sector":11.7,"verdict":"—"},{"k"